---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import PromptBlock from '../../components/PromptBlock.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Marketing cookbook · Pace"
  description="Marketing recipes for the Pace marketplace. Weekly campaign brief. Content drafting that knows your brand voice. Performance reports you don't have to assemble."
  activeNav="cookbook"
  canonicalPath="/cookbook/marketing"
>
  <article class="usecases-page">
    <header class="usecases-team-page-head">
      <a class="usecases-back-link" href="/cookbook">&larr; All cookbooks</a>
      <span class="usecases-eyebrow">Marketing cookbook</span>
      <h1>Marketing</h1>
      <p class="usecases-team-page-tagline">Weekly campaign brief. Content drafting that knows your brand voice. Performance reports you don't have to assemble.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="usecases-team-page-body">
<article class="usecase-card usecase-card-marquee">
        <span class="usecase-card-badge">Marquee recipe</span>
        <h3>Weekly campaign performance digest, Fridays at 4pm</h3>
        <p class="usecase-outcome">The marketing team walks into Monday already aligned on what shipped last week.</p>
        <dl class="usecase-meta">
          <div><dt>Trigger</dt><dd>Routine, schedule, weekly Friday 16:00</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Skills</dt><dd><code>performance-report</code>, <code>write-query</code></dd></div>
          <div><dt>Features</dt><dd>Routines (cloud schedule), Amplitude + HubSpot connectors, cross-plugin chain</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <p>The team walks into Monday already aligned on what shipped last week and how it performed. The digest is in <code>#marketing-weekly</code> by Friday afternoon, pulled from Amplitude funnels and HubSpot lead sources without anyone touching a spreadsheet.</p>

        <div class="usecase-setup">
          <h4 class="usecase-setup-title">How to set it up</h4>
          <ol class="usecase-steps">
            <li class="usecase-step">
              <span class="usecase-step-num">1</span>
              <div class="usecase-step-body">
                <h5>Install marketing + data plugins</h5>
                <p>Marketing has the report skill; data has the SQL skill it leans on.</p>
                <div class="usecase-step-actions">
                  <a class="usecase-step-btn" href="https://claude.ai/desktop/customize/plugins/new?marketplace=GoldenBerry-SO/Pace&plugin=marketing" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Install in Cowork &nearr;</a>
                  <code class="usecase-step-cmd">npx pace-tools install marketing data</code>
                </div>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="usecase-step">
              <span class="usecase-step-num">2</span>
              <div class="usecase-step-body">
                <h5>Authorize Amplitude, HubSpot, and Slack</h5>
                <p>The first time you run any marketing or data skill, OAuth windows open one by one. Sign into each once. Amplitude is the analytics source; HubSpot is the CRM; Slack is where the digest lands.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="usecase-step">
              <span class="usecase-step-num">3</span>
              <div class="usecase-step-body">
                <h5>Create the scheduled routine</h5>
                <p>In Cowork, open <strong>Routines</strong> &rarr; <strong>New routine</strong>. Pick <strong>Schedule</strong>, set to <strong>Weekly &middot; Friday &middot; 16:00</strong>.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="usecase-step">
              <span class="usecase-step-num">4</span>
              <div class="usecase-step-body">
                <h5>Paste this as the routine prompt</h5>
                <p>Edit the channel name and the metrics list to match your team's KPIs.</p>
                <PromptBlock prompt={`Run performance-report covering the past 7 days.
Pull funnel metrics from Amplitude (signups, activations,
free-to-paid conversion) and lead-source attribution from
HubSpot. Use write-query if you need to grab anything
the report skill doesn't have directly. Format as a Slack
digest: headline numbers at the top, week-over-week deltas,
top 3 campaigns by impact, anything anomalous worth a closer
look. Post to #marketing-weekly.`} />
              </div>
            </li>
            <li class="usecase-step">
              <span class="usecase-step-num">5</span>
              <div class="usecase-step-body">
                <h5>Click <strong>Run now</strong> to verify</h5>
                <p>First run takes a few minutes (it has to authenticate Amplitude on the cloud side too). The digest lands in <code>#marketing-weekly</code>. Future Fridays at 16:00 are automatic.</p>
              </div>
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="usecase-card">
        <h3>Brand-voice gate on every external draft</h3>
        <dl class="usecase-meta">
          <div><dt>Trigger</dt><dd>Routine, GitHub trigger on <code>pull_request.opened</code> in the marketing repo</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Skills</dt><dd><code>brand-voice-enforcement</code>, <code>draft-content</code></dd></div>
          <div><dt>Features</dt><dd>Routines (GitHub trigger), brand-voice plugin, inline PR comments</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <p>Any PR that touches landing pages, blog posts, or email templates auto-runs <code>brand-voice-enforcement</code> and posts inline comments with concrete fixes. Catches drift before it ships; pair with <code>draft-content</code> when a section needs a rewrite from scratch.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="usecase-card">
        <h3>Auto-build the launch comms kit when a Linear cycle ships</h3>
        <dl class="usecase-meta">
          <div><dt>Trigger</dt><dd>Routine, GitHub event when a release branch merges to main</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Skills</dt><dd><code>draft-content</code>, <code>brand-voice-enforcement</code></dd></div>
          <div><dt>Features</dt><dd>Routines (GitHub event), Linear + Notion connectors, plan mode for review</dd></div>
        </dl>
        <p>When a release branch merges, the routine reads the cycle's shipped issues, drafts the announcement post, the changelog entry, and the customer-facing one-pager in one go. Brand-voice enforcement runs over each artifact. Everything lands in Notion under a single page for your review before anything goes out.</p>
              <PromptBlock prompt={`When a release branch merges to main, read the shipped issues from Linear in that cycle. Draft the launch comms kit in Notion under a single page:

1. A blog announcement post (in our brand voice).
2. The changelog entry for the public release notes.
3. A customer-facing one-pager.

Run brand-voice-enforcement over each artifact. Park everything in plan mode for the marketing lead's review before anything goes out.`} label="Launch comms prompt" />
      </article>

      <article class="usecase-card">
        <h3>Weekly content calendar generated from the strategy doc</h3>
        <p>Pull the quarterly themes from your strategy doc, the upcoming product launches from Linear, and any event tie-ins from the calendar. The routine drafts a week of planned posts across blog, social, and email (with platform-specific drafts for each), parks them in plan mode for review, and posts the calendar to #content for visibility.</p>
        <dl class="usecase-meta">
          <div><dt>Trigger</dt><dd>Routine, schedule, weekly Wednesday 13:00</dd></div>
          <div><dt>Skills</dt><dd><code>campaign-plan</code>, <code>draft-content</code></dd></div>
          <div><dt>Features</dt><dd>Routines (cloud schedule), Notion + Linear connectors, plan mode for review</dd></div>
        </dl>
              <PromptBlock prompt={`Every Wednesday at 1pm, pull the quarterly themes from the strategy doc in Notion, upcoming product launches from Linear, and any event tie-ins from the calendar. Draft a week of planned posts: one blog topic, three social posts (LinkedIn + X + threads versions), one email to the newsletter list.

Park the calendar in Notion plan mode for the marketing lead to review, then post the approved version to #content for the week.`} label="Content-calendar prompt" />
      </article>
    </div>

    <footer class="usecases-footer">
      <p>
        Have a marketing workflow that should live here? <a href="https://github.com/GoldenBerry-SO/Pace/issues/new">Open an issue</a> with the trigger, skills, and Claude features it uses; we'll fold it into the cookbook.
      </p>
    </footer>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .usecases-page {
    max-width: var(--width-content);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--spacing-xl) var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-3xl);
  }
  .usecases-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
    padding-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-mist);
  }
  .usecases-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--fs-xs);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-forest);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .usecases-header h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--fs-3xl);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
  }
  .usecases-lede {
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
    color: var(--color-charcoal);
    line-height: 1.55;
    max-width: 68ch;
  }
  .usecases-lede strong {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  /* Engineering callout above the TOC */
  .usecases-eng-callout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
    gap: var(--spacing-lg);
    align-items: center;
    background: var(--color-forest);
    color: var(--color-paper);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-xl);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
  }
  .usecases-eng-callout-eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-paper);
    opacity: 0.78;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .usecases-eng-callout-eyebrow::before {
    content: "";
    display: inline-block;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    background: currentColor;
  }
  .usecases-eng-callout-text h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.3rem, 2.4vw, 1.7rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--color-paper);
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .usecases-eng-callout-text p {
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-paper);
    opacity: 0.85;
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 56ch;
  }
  .usecases-eng-callout-cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 12px 20px;
    background: var(--color-paper);
    color: var(--color-forest);
    border-radius: 2px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: transform var(--duration-base) var(--ease-out-quart);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .usecases-eng-callout-cta:hover {
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .usecases-eng-callout {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      padding: var(--spacing-md);
    }
  }

  /* TOC grid */
  .usecases-toc {
    background: var(--color-paper-elev);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-mist);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-md);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-2xl);
  }
  .usecases-toc-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-ash);
    display: block;
    margin: 0 6px var(--spacing-sm);
  }
  .usecases-toc-grid {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .usecases-toc-grid a {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
    padding: 10px 14px;
    background: var(--color-paper);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-mist);
    border-radius: 8px;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    transition: border-color var(--duration-fast) var(--ease-out-quart),
                background var(--duration-fast) var(--ease-out-quart),
                transform var(--duration-fast) var(--ease-out-quart);
  }
  .usecases-toc-grid a:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-forest);
    background: var(--color-forest-dim);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }
  .usecases-toc-name {
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }
  .usecases-toc-count {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--color-ash);
  }
  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .usecases-toc-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }
  .usecases-team {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-2xl);
    scroll-margin-top: 96px;
  }
  .usecases-team-head {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
    padding-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-mist);
  }
  .usecases-team-head h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--fs-xl);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);
  }
  .usecases-team-tagline {
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    color: var(--color-ash);
    line-height: 1.55;
    max-width: 70ch;
  }
  .usecase-card {
    padding: var(--spacing-lg);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-mist);
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--color-paper-elev);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
  }
  .usecase-card-marquee {
    border-color: var(--color-forest);
    background: color-mix(in oklch, var(--color-paper-elev) 92%, var(--color-forest-dim));
  }
  .usecase-card-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-forest);
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-forest-soft);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 4px 8px;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
  }
  .usecase-card-badge::before {
    content: "";
    display: inline-block;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    background: currentColor;
  }
  .usecase-card h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--fs-xl);
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.022em;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-md);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .usecase-card > p {
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-charcoal);
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-md);
  }
  /* Meta: small chip row at the bottom (was a big dl block at top) */
  .usecase-meta {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 6px 8px;
    margin: var(--spacing-md) 0 0;
    padding-top: var(--spacing-md);
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--color-mist);
  }
  .usecase-meta > div {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    background: var(--color-paper);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-mist);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }
  .usecase-meta dt {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-ash);
    margin: 0;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .usecase-meta dt::after {
    content: ":";
    margin-left: 1px;
    color: var(--color-mist);
  }
  .usecase-meta dd {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-charcoal);
    font-size: 11px;
  }
  .usecase-meta dd code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.95em;
    color: var(--color-forest);
    background: transparent;
    padding: 0;
    border: 0;
  }
  .usecase-card p {
    font-size: var(--fs-base);
    color: var(--color-charcoal);
    line-height: 1.65;
    max-width: 70ch;
  }
  .usecase-card p code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.92em;
    background: var(--color-code-bg);
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-code-border);
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }
  .usecases-footer {
    margin-top: var(--spacing-2xl);
    padding-top: var(--spacing-lg);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-mist);
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    color: var(--color-ash);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .usecases-footer a {
    color: var(--color-forest);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-forest-soft);
  }
  .usecases-impeccable {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--spacing-lg);
  }
  .usecases-impeccable-pitch h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }
  .usecases-impeccable-pitch p {
    font-size: var(--fs-base);
    color: var(--color-charcoal);
    line-height: 1.65;
    max-width: 70ch;
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
  }
  .usecases-impeccable-pitch a,
  .usecases-impeccable-when a,
  .usecases-team-tagline a {
    color: var(--color-forest);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-forest-soft);
  }
  .usecases-impeccable-pitch code,
  .usecases-impeccable-when code,
  .usecases-team-tagline code {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.9em;
    background: var(--color-code-bg);
    padding: 1px 6px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-code-border);
    color: var(--color-ink);
  }
  .usecases-impeccable-cta {
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--spacing-sm);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .usecases-impeccable-cta .cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 10px 18px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: background var(--duration-fast) var(--ease-out-quart), color var(--duration-fast) var(--ease-out-quart);
  }
  .cta-primary {
    background: var(--color-forest);
    color: var(--color-paper);
  }
  .cta-primary:hover {
    background: var(--color-forest-hover);
  }
  .cta-secondary {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-forest);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-forest-soft);
  }
  .cta-secondary:hover {
    background: var(--color-forest-dim);
  }
  .usecases-impeccable-when {
    background: var(--color-paper-elev);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-mist);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: var(--spacing-md) var(--spacing-lg);
  }
  .usecases-impeccable-when summary {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--fs-md);
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-ink);
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .usecases-impeccable-when summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }
  .usecases-impeccable-when summary::before {
    content: '+';
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: var(--color-forest);
    margin-right: var(--spacing-sm);
    transition: transform var(--duration-fast) var(--ease-out-quart);
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .usecases-impeccable-when[open] summary::before {
    content: '−';
  }
  .usecases-impeccable-when p,
  .usecases-impeccable-when ul {
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    color: var(--color-charcoal);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-top: var(--spacing-sm);
    max-width: 70ch;
  }
  .usecases-impeccable-when ul {
    padding-left: var(--spacing-md);
  }
  .usecases-impeccable-when li {
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xs);
  }
  .usecases-impeccable-when strong {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .usecase-meta > div {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2px;
    }
  }

  /* Recipe card outcome-first ordering: prose before pills */
  .usecase-card {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .usecase-card h3 { order: 1; }
  .usecase-card-badge { order: 0; }
  .usecase-card > p { order: 2; }
  .usecase-card .usecase-meta { order: 3; margin-top: var(--spacing-md); }


  /* Outcome line at the top of every marquee card. Big bold one-liner
     that tells the visitor what they actually get before the prose. */
  .usecase-outcome {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: var(--fs-lg);
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--color-forest);
    margin: 0 0 var(--spacing-md);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    padding: 12px 16px;
    background: var(--color-forest-dim);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-forest);
    border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0;
  }
  .usecase-setup-title {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: var(--spacing-md);
    margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
    padding: 4px 10px;
    background: var(--color-paper);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-mist);
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-forest);
  }
  .usecase-card > .usecase-setup,
  .usecase-card > .usecase-step-prompt,
  .usecase-card-marquee .usecase-setup { order: 4; }
</style>
